    "hook": "Joy at an unreasonable speed.",
    "why": "<p>Freedom08 is the one that doesn't look like a demon at all. Cream columns, soft pastels, open light &mdash; and then it plays like everything else here. That contrast is the whole appeal.</p><p>It's a reminder that this difficulty tier doesn't have to mean darkness and red. Somebody decided extreme demons could be pretty and just did it.</p>",
